    {
      "id":"EVT_TWO_REALMS_003","version":1,"title":"失落的界种","body":"守护界种的青木族修士带着一截活根突围。只要活根尚存，即便主根被夺，灵界仍有机会重新培育界种。玄烬化身已经追上他；另一道绯色月光也从魔渊深处赶来，似乎同样想得到活根。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","story_chain","two_realms_war","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"rescue_thunder","text":"催动遁术救走护根修士（MP 至少 100,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"mp","op":"gte","value":100000},{"stat":"mp_ratio","op":"gte","value":0.60}],"failure_reason":"遁光被玄烬魔焰击碎","success_text":"你的遁光卷住活根与伤员，抢在魔焰落下前脱身。"},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"two_realms_thunder_ally","if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TWO_REALMS_004","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
        {"id":"fight_six","text":"正面截住玄烬化身（战斗力至少 6,750,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"combat_power","op":"gte","value":6750000}],"failure_reason":"玄烬化身以魔功吞尽你的精元","success_text":"玄烬化身被你逼退，绯色月光中的强者终于现身。"},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"two_realms_repulsed_six","if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TWO_REALMS_004","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
        {"id":"mislead","text":"以幻术化出假根，将追兵引向魔渊","effects":[{"type":"restore_mp","value":-0.15},{"type":"add_opportunity","value":18},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"two_realms_clever_route"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TWO_REALMS_004"}]},
        {"id":"bargain_six","text":"向玄烬圣祖出卖护根修士的行踪","effects":[{"type":"add_karma","value":18},{"type":"add_fame","value":8},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TWO_REALMS_004"}]}
      ]
