    {
      "id":"EVT_TWO_REALMS_004","version":1,"title":"绯月现身","body":"来者是被玄烬逐出真魔界的绯月圣祖。她曾镇守北域万年，知道灵脉枯竭并非无解：天墟岛中留有一眼万劫雷池，可以洗去界种病根。玄烬不肯等待，是因为一旦北域得救，他借灾劫吞并诸部的谋划便会败露。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","story_chain","two_realms_war","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"ally","text":"与绯月联手逼退玄烬化身（战斗力至少 6,500,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"combat_power","op":"gte","value":6500000}],"failure_reason":"你被两位圣祖交锋的余波抹去","success_text":"你封住玄烬化身退路，绯月以月轮魔焰将其彻底击溃。"},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"baohua_respected_strength","if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TWO_REALMS_005","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
        {"id":"intel","text":"交出魔军布防与玄烬化身动向","effects":[{"type":"add_opportunity","value":20},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"baohua_respected_wit"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TWO_REALMS_005"}]},
        {"id":"neutral","text":"保持中立，只听她说明交易","effects":[{"type":"add_karma","value":-2},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TWO_REALMS_005"}]},
        {"id":"attack","text":"趁两祖交锋，强夺界种活根（战斗力至少 8,300,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"combat_power","op":"gte","value":8300000},{"stat":"mp_ratio","op":"gte","value":0.70}],"failure_reason":"绯月魔火穿透护体灵光，你的元神随贪念一同焚尽","success_text":"你没能独占活根，却迫使绯月承认你有资格参与此局。"},{"type":"add_karma","value":25,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_TWO_REALMS_005","if_result":["check_success"]}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id":"EVT_TWO_REALMS_005","version":1,"title":"两界盟誓","body":"绯月愿以心魔起誓：她会带活根进入天墟岛，洗去病根后将界种一分为二，让两界各自重栽。作为交换，灵界联军必须助她夺回通往天墟岛的古路。她先交出定魂丹与两界盟符，选择是否相信她则在你。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","story_chain","two_realms_war","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"peace_clause","text":"接受合作，并要求她以心魔立誓归还半数界种","effects":[{"type":"add_item","item_id":"baohua_soul_pill"},{"type":"add_item","item_id":"baohua_covenant"},{"type":"add_karma","value":-10},{"type":"add_fame","value":18},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"baohua_cooperation_completed"},{"type":"set_milestone","milestone":"two_realms_war_completed"}]},
        {"id":"pool_clause","text":"接受合作，换取天墟岛与万劫雷池情报","effects":[{"type":"add_item","item_id":"baohua_soul_pill"},{"type":"add_item","item_id":"baohua_covenant"},{"type":"add_opportunity","value":35},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"baohua_pool_route"},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"baohua_cooperation_completed"},{"type":"set_milestone","milestone":"two_realms_war_completed"}]},
        {"id":"reward_only","text":"只收丹药，不替两界许下承诺","effects":[{"type":"add_item","item_id":"baohua_soul_pill"},{"type":"add_fame","value":6},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"baohua_cooperation_completed"},{"type":"set_milestone","milestone":"two_realms_war_completed"}]},
        {"id":"refuse","text":"拒绝合作，各走各路","effects":[{"type":"add_heart_demon","value":2},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"baohua_cooperation_refused"}]}
      ]
