    {
      "id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_001","version":1,"title":"天墟岛线索","body":"两界盟符中封着一幅残图，指向漂泊在真魔界罡风海上的天墟岛。岛中万劫雷池可以淬炼法体，太初魂芝则能温养元神；更重要的是，雷池或许能够洗去界种病根。玄烬圣祖早已派人封锁附近海域。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","story_chain","bitter_spirit_island","probability_gate"],"weight":0,"repeat":"once","trigger":{"milestone":"bitter_island_eligible","base_chance":0.20,"unit_increment":0.02},
      "conditions":{"all":[{"path":"player.world","op":"eq","value":"spirit"},{"path":"player.realm_index","op":"eq","value":7}]},
      "choices":[
        {"id":"covenant","text":"持两界盟符开启绯月留下的秘路","conditions":{"has_item":"baohua_covenant"},"disabled_reason":"你没有两界盟符","effects":[{"type":"set_flag","flag":"bitter_island_covenant_route"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_002"}]},
        {"id":"disguise","text":"伪装成魔族商队护卫潜入","effects":[{"type":"restore_mp","value":-0.10},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"bitter_island_disguise"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_002"}]},
        {"id":"rift","text":"冒险穿越不稳定界缝（HP、MP 均至少 80,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"hp","op":"gte","value":80000},{"stat":"mp","op":"gte","value":80000}],"failure_reason":"肉身与元神一同碎在界缝中","success_text":"你在界缝闭合前坠入罡风海外缘。"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_002","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
        {"id":"abandon","text":"将地图封存，不冒此险","effects":[{"type":"add_opportunity","value":8},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"bitter_island_incomplete"}]}
      ]
