    {
      "id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_002","version":1,"title":"横渡罡风海","body":"天墟岛外没有海水，只有能够削骨蚀魂的黑色罡风。玄烬麾下的巡天魔舟守住三条安全航道，风海深处又有逐灵兽循着修士法力追猎。想靠近天墟岛，隐匿、硬闯和夺舟都各有凶险。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","story_chain","bitter_spirit_island","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"silent","text":"敛尽气息，借罡风阴影潜行（MP 至少 90,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"mp","op":"gte","value":90000},{"stat":"mp_ratio","op":"gte","value":0.55}],"failure_reason":"敛息法在风眼中破裂，逐灵兽群循着法力追来","success_text":"你避过巡天魔舟，在风眼转换前抵达天墟岛外。"},{"type":"restore_mp","value":-0.16,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_003","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
        {"id":"body","text":"以法体硬抗魔气潮汐（HP 至少 85,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"hp","op":"gte","value":85000},{"stat":"hp_ratio","op":"gte","value":0.65}],"failure_reason":"魔气侵入法体，肉身魔化崩解","success_text":"你横穿潮汐，肉身只受轻创。"},{"type":"damage","value":0.18,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_003","if_result":["injured"]}]},
        {"id":"ambush","text":"夺取巡天魔舟直闯禁区（战斗力至少 6,100,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"combat_power","op":"gte","value":6100000}],"failure_reason":"你被魔舟战阵困死在罡风海中","success_text":"魔舟易主，沿途关卡误以为你是玄烬麾下巡使。"},{"type":"add_sha_qi","value":8,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_003","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
