    {
      "id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_003","version":1,"title":"守墟玄猿","body":"岛门前坐着一头被锁了万年的玄猿。它本是天墟岛护山灵兽，玄烬却以锁魂钉控制其神智，逼它猎杀所有来客。绯月留下的盟符能唤醒片刻旧识，你也可以引开玄烬神念、强行断锁，或冒险进入玄猿识海。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","story_chain","bitter_spirit_island","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"show_covenant","text":"催动两界盟符，唤醒玄猿旧识","conditions":{"has_item":"baohua_covenant"},"disabled_reason":"你没有两界盟符","effects":[{"type":"set_flag","flag":"bitter_island_guard_deceived"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_004"}]},
        {"id":"lure","text":"制造绯月气息，将玄烬神念引往外海","effects":[{"type":"restore_mp","value":-0.20},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"bitter_island_guard_lured"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_004"}]},
        {"id":"fight","text":"正面击碎玄猿身上的锁魂钉（战斗力至少 7,400,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"combat_power","op":"gte","value":7400000},{"stat":"hp_ratio","op":"gte","value":0.60}],"failure_reason":"玄猿发狂撕裂你的护体灵光","success_text":"锁魂钉尽碎，玄猿恢复清明，为你让开岛门。"},{"type":"add_sha_qi","value":12,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_004","if_result":["check_success"]}]},
        {"id":"possess","text":"进入玄猿识海斩去奴印（心魔不高于 30）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"heart_demon","op":"lte","value":30},{"stat":"mp","op":"gte","value":95000}],"failure_reason":"玄猿万年疯念反灌，你的元神被兽性吞没","success_text":"奴印被斩，玄猿从长久噩梦中醒来。"},{"type":"add_heart_demon","value":5,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_004","if_result":["check_success"]}]}
      ]
