    {
      "id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_004","version":1,"title":"雷池与魂芝","body":"岛心万劫雷池由历代飞升者散落的劫雷汇成，入池可重炼经脉与法体；崖上的太初魂芝则以雷火为养分，千年才成熟一株。两种造化并非不能兼得，但雷霆炼体时元神必须归窍，采芝又需神游崖顶，稍有差错便会形神俱灭。",
      "tags":["realm:integration","story_chain","bitter_spirit_island","manual_only"],"weight":0,
      "choices":[
        {"id":"bathe","text":"先入万劫雷池淬炼法体（HP、MP 均至少 90,000）","effects":[{"type":"attribute_check","checks":[{"stat":"hp","op":"gte","value":90000},{"stat":"mp","op":"gte","value":90000},{"stat":"hp_ratio","op":"gte","value":0.65}],"failure_reason":"法体无法承受万劫雷火，当场崩解","success_text":"雷火洗过每一条经脉，肉身与元神重新浑成一体。"},{"type":"damage","value":0.25,"if_result":["check_success"]},{"type":"restore_mp","value":-0.25,"if_result":["injured"]},{"type":"set_flag","flag":"bitter_island_bathed"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_BITTER_ISLAND_005"}]},
